WEBVTT

00:00:00.218 --> 00:00:10.591
Charge by <b>card or transfer</b>, and to a customer

00:00:10.753 --> 00:00:14.703
If they pay by card or transfer, choose <b>Electrónico</b> (electronic)

00:00:14.822 --> 00:00:18.214
If you want, write down the payment reference to find it later

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:22.537
Want to know what each customer buys? Add them to the sale

00:00:22.587 --> 00:00:30.724
New customer? Register them right there, without leaving the sale

00:00:30.849 --> 00:00:35.282
Check out, and the sale goes into your customer's <b>history</b>
